# React and UI

See also [`docs/contributing.md`](docs/contributing.md) for stack and Definition
of Done.

- Functional components and TypeScript only
- Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes; no new CSS frameworks
- Prefer shadcn/ui from `@/components/ui/*`; do not hand-roll duplicates
- Add missing primitives with
  `deno run -A npm:shadcn@latest add <name>`
- Import from `@/` (maps to `src/`)

## TSDoc

Required on **exported** functions, hooks, types, and classes. Skip tiny private
helpers. Document purpose and non-obvious params/returns; do not restate the
type signature.

```ts
/** Merges class names and resolves Tailwind conflicts. */
export function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]): string
```

## Validation

When adding runtime validation, use Zod v4 syntax (not Zod v3 patterns).
